# SkyOps memory migration — initial classification, 2026-09-15
#
# One-time map that files the pre-SkyOps flat memory store into the categories
# defined in memory/SCHEMA.md. Applied with:
#
#   pwsh ~/.claude/bin/skyops-memory.ps1 migrate -Map <this file>
#
# Columns (whitespace separated, '-' = leave unset):
#   name  category  status  ticket  ticket_state
#
# Re-running is safe: the map is declarative, so applying it twice produces the
# same frontmatter. Entries already archived are reported as "not found".

